{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doodle: Defense is an exciting roguelite tower defense game in which you play as a mining vessel defending yourself against the planets inhabitants!\u00a0 Use ink to fire bullets and level up to upgrade yourself and add defenses!\u00a0 Extraction will take 20 minutes, good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does a full release look like?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapons:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 weapons - to remain secret for now</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bosses:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 main bosses which appear every 5 minutes or so</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss upgrades (you get the upgrade, not the boss)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Bases:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different bases with different stats and graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Enemies:\u00a0</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special spawns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Difficulties:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulties for both a harder time and an easier time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game Modes:\u00a0Extremely Optional</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game modes, unlockable</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes are optional to the scope of this project.\u00a0 If they don't happen, just know they either weren't fun enough to release, or were not possible with this project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customization</u>:<u>\u00a0Extremely Optional</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a huge fan of customizing stuff in games so a possible goal is to allow customizing units/bosses/bases/backgrounds with your own assets or choosing colors.\u00a0 Definitely depends on time/motivation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Achievements</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Controller Support</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Steam Deck Support?</u></strong>\u00a0(This is a maybe because the behavior of some enemies may not work on such a small screen)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enemy Kills I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/8382310b43705f77f746f84460f376233d980e7b.jpg"},{"name":"Enemy Kills II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/b51684075862594149b4c44fd87b03c93f642271.jpg"},{"name":"Enemy Kills III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/36ceb587f4696ae901d8f63654b6fe8ec6dd706e.jpg"},{"name":"Enemy Kills IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/c51409d0466472f87535db633137a1ea81fd2325.jpg"},{"name":"Enemy Kills V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/00eb776bc01ce1ab211a657c8036e28ccc293120.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Money I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/a9b10886e31fed059fe6ac44ba57678e3585e2be.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Money II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/cde90b403329ec742b329837c486d222b36bab50.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Money III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/49aae1c5cebd7c815ace38537aa63e7359688a3c.jpg"},{"name":"Blood Money IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3901530/f3f4ccae4897fd70324171b56277d39b26584d7f.jpg"},{"name":"Blood M